// oWakaka P0 对话壳：三框布局——左侧会话栏（可拖宽）| 右上对话区 | 右下输入区（可拖高）。
// 助手气泡含思考过程三态展示（收起/部分/全开）。
// 当前为硬编码深色配色，浅色/深色自适应后续增量处理。

import { Button, ScrollView, TextEdit } from "std-widgets.slint";

/// 一条聊天消息（气泡数据源）
export struct ChatMessage {
    role: string, // "user" | "assistant"
    text: string, // 回答正文
    thinking: string, // 思考过程全文（仅 assistant；无思考时为空）
    tstate: int, // 思考展示态：0 收起 | 1 部分（最多5行，自适应）| 2 全开
    tauto: bool, // 未被手动干预：思考完成时"部分"态自动转收起
}

/// 单条消息：assistant = Thinking 按钮 + 思考面板 + 回答卡 + 复制钮；user = 右对齐回答卡。
/// 回答卡宽度随内容自适应（上限 82%）；思考面板固定占宽 82%，收起时由 ScrollView 原生裁剪，不外泄。
component Bubble inherits Rectangle {
    in property <ChatMessage> msg;
    callback think-toggled();
    callback copy-request(string);

    property <bool> has-thinking: msg.role == "assistant" && msg.thinking != "";
    property <bool> thinking-open: has-thinking && msg.tstate != 0;
    property <bool> has-answer: msg.text != ""; // user 消息恒非空

    // —— 思考切换按钮：附在回答气泡上方左侧，文字统一为 Thinking…… ——
    think-btn := TouchArea {
        visible: root.has-thinking;
        x: 16px;
        y: 4px;
        width: think-lbl.width + 8px;
        height: think-lbl.height + 6px;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => { root.think-toggled(); }
        think-lbl := Text {
            x: 4px;
            y: 3px;
            text: (root.msg.tstate == 0 ? "▸ " : "▾ ") + "Thinking……";
            color: #8f96a3;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    }

    // —— 思考内容面板：透明灰底 + 半透明灰边框 + 圆角；
    //      部分态最多 5 行、按内容自适应高度、滚轮可自由回看；全开态完整展示 ——
    think-frame := Rectangle {
        visible: root.thinking-open;
        x: 16px;
        y: think-btn.y + think-btn.height + 4px;
        width: root.width * 0.82;
        height: think-view.height + 12px;
        background: #ffffff0a;
        border-width: 1px;
        border-color: #6b728099;
        border-radius: 8px;
        clip: true;

        // 嵌套 ScrollView 会丢滚轮（外层截获 + 行更新重建），改为自绘滚动视图：
        // user-vy 存用户滚动位置；哨兵值 = 自动贴底（跟随最新内容）
        think-view := Rectangle {
            property <length> bottom: min(0px, self.height - think-text.height); // 全滚到底时的位置(≤0)
            property <length> user-vy: 10000000px; // 哨兵 = 贴底跟随
            property <length> eff-vy: user-vy >= 10000000px
                ? bottom
                : min(0px, max(bottom, user-vy));

            x: 6px;
            y: 6px;
            width: parent.width - 12px;
            // 部分态：内容不足 5 行（90px）时自适应收小，超出才滚动
            height: root.msg.tstate == 1 ? min(think-text.height, 90px) : think-text.height;

            think-text := Text {
                y: parent.eff-vy;
                width: parent.width - 8px;
                text: root.msg.thinking;
                wrap: word-wrap;
                color: #b8bec8;
                font-size: 13px;
            }
            // 滚轮直接处理（accept 阻止外层列表截获）：落回底部 2px 内恢复贴底跟随
            wheel-touch := TouchArea {
                width: parent.width;
                height: parent.height;
                scroll-event(ev) => {
                    think-view.user-vy =
                        (min(0px, max(think-view.bottom, think-view.eff-vy + ev.delta-y))
                            - think-view.bottom) <= 2px
                            ? 10000000px
                            : min(0px, max(think-view.bottom, think-view.eff-vy + ev.delta-y));
                    accept;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // —— 回答卡：宽度取正文自然宽（preferred-width），上限 82%，靠向发言侧 ——
    answer := Rectangle {
        property <bool> is-user: root.msg.role == "user";
        visible: root.has-answer;
        width: min(max(msg-text.preferred-width + 24px, 48px), root.width * 0.82);
        x: is-user ? root.width - self.width - 16px : 16px;
        y: thinking-open ? think-frame.y + think-frame.height + 4px
            : has-thinking ? think-btn.y + think-btn.height + 4px
            : 6px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: is-user ? #2f6fed : #2c2e35;
        height: msg-text.height + 16px;

        msg-text := Text {
            x: 12px;
            y: 8px;
            width: parent.width - 24px;
            text: root.msg.text;
            wrap: word-wrap;
            color: #f3f4f6;
            horizontal-alignment: answer.is-user ? right : left;
        }
    }

    // —— 复制按钮：回答气泡下方的最右边 ——
    copy-btn := TouchArea {
        visible: answer.visible && root.msg.role == "assistant";
        x: answer.x + answer.width - self.width;
        y: answer.y + answer.height + 2px;
        width: copy-lbl.width + 12px;
        height: copy-lbl.height + 6px;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => { root.copy-request(root.msg.text); }
        copy-lbl := Text {
            x: 6px;
            y: 3px;
            text: "复制";
            color: #8f96a3;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    }

    height: root.has-answer
        ? answer.y + answer.height + (copy-btn.visible ? copy-btn.height + 4px : 12px)
        : (thinking-open ? think-frame.y + think-frame.height : think-btn.y + think-btn.height) + 12px;
}

/// 侧栏一行数据源：会话标题 + 是否选中。
export struct SessionItem {
    title: string,
    active: bool,
}

/// 侧栏列表的一行：圆角条，选中/悬停高亮，超长标题省略号。
component SessionRow inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> title;
    in property <bool> active;
    callback row-clicked();

    height: 38px;
    ta := TouchArea {
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => { root.row-clicked(); }
    }
    Rectangle {
        x: 2px;
        y: 2px;
        width: parent.width - 4px;
        height: parent.height - 4px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        background: root.active ? #2f6fed3d : (ta.has-hover ? #ffffff12 : transparent);
        Text {
            x: 10px;
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            width: parent.width - 20px;
            text: root.title;
            color: root.active ? #e6e9ef : #aeb4bf;
            font-size: 13px;
            overflow: elide;
        }
    }
}

/// 左侧会话栏卡片：顶部「开始新对话」，下方会话列表可滚动。
component SessionSidebar inherits Rectangle {
    in property <[SessionItem]> sessions;
    callback new-clicked();
    callback row-clicked(int);

    background: #1e2026;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: #ffffff14;
    clip: true;

    VerticalLayout {
        padding: 10px;
        spacing: 8px;

        new-btn := Rectangle {
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: #ffffff26;
            background: nt.has-hover ? #ffffff1a : #ffffff0d;
            nt := TouchArea {
                width: parent.width;
                height: parent.height;
                mouse-cursor: pointer;
                clicked => { root.new-clicked(); }
            }
            Text {
                width: parent.width;
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                text: "+ 开始新对话";
                color: #d7dade;
                font-size: 14px;
                horizontal-alignment: center;
            }
        }

        ScrollView {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 2px;
                for s[index] in root.sessions: SessionRow {
                    title: s.title;
                    active: s.active;
                    row-clicked => { root.row-clicked(index); }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

/// 纵向拖拽条：position = 左栏宽度。按住拖动即改写 position（打断外部初始
/// 绑定后钉死），悬停/拖动时小白条提亮；取值范围由使用方 min/max 约束。
component VSplitter inherits Rectangle {
    in-out property <length> position;
    in property <length> min-pos;
    in property <length> max-pos;
    property <length> grab: 0px;
    property <length> start-pos: 0px;

    width: 12px;
    ta := TouchArea {
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height;
        mouse-cursor: col-resize;
        // 按下瞬间记录：按下处与当时的 position（moved 仅在按住时触发）
        changed pressed => {
            if (self.pressed) {
                root.grab = self.mouse-x;
                root.start-pos = root.position;
            }
        }
        moved => {
            root.position = Math.max(root.min-pos, Math.min(root.max-pos,
                root.start-pos + self.mouse-x - root.grab));
        }
    }
    Rectangle {
        width: 3px;
        height: parent.height * 0.3;
        x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
        y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: white;
        opacity: (ta.pressed || ta.has-hover) ? 0.85 : 0.18;
    }
}

/// 横向拖拽条：position = 输入区高度；向上拖增高（delta 取负）。
component HSplitter inherits Rectangle {
    in-out property <length> position;
    in property <length> min-pos;
    in property <length> max-pos;
    property <length> grab: 0px;
    property <length> start-pos: 0px;

    height: 12px;
    ta := TouchArea {
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height;
        mouse-cursor: row-resize;
        changed pressed => {
            if (self.pressed) {
                root.grab = self.mouse-y;
                root.start-pos = root.position;
            }
        }
        // position = 输入区高度：向下拖（mouse-y 增大）则减小
        moved => {
            root.position = Math.max(root.min-pos, Math.min(root.max-pos,
                root.start-pos + root.grab - self.mouse-y));
        }
    }
    Rectangle {
        width: parent.width * 0.25;
        height: 3px;
        x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
        y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
        border-radius: 2px;
        background: white;
        opacity: (ta.pressed || ta.has-hover) ? 0.85 : 0.18;
    }
}

/// 输入区卡片：总高由外层拖拽条（HSplitter.position）控制；
/// 编辑器吃满剩余高度，内容超出时编辑器内部滚动。
component InputArea inherits Rectangle {
    in property <bool> busy;
    callback send-submit(string);

    background: #1e2026;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: #ffffff14;

    ed := TextEdit {
        x: 12px;
        y: 10px;
        width: parent.width - 24px;
        // 54 = 上 10 + 间距 6 + 按钮行 28 + 下 10；下限 24px 防拖到最小时塌陷
        height: Math.max(24px, root.height - 54px);
        font-size: 14px;
        placeholder-text: "输入消息，Ctrl+Enter 发送（Enter 换行）";
        enabled: !root.busy;
        // 先于编辑器处理按键：Ctrl+Enter 发送并吞掉；普通 Enter 放行 → 换行
        key-pressed(ev) => {
            if (ev.text == "\n" && ev.modifiers.control) {
                if (!root.busy && self.text != "") {
                    root.send-submit(self.text);
                    self.text = "";
                }
                accept;
            }
            reject;
        }
    }

    btn-row := HorizontalLayout {
        x: 12px;
        y: root.height - 28px - 10px;
        width: parent.width - 24px;
        // 显式高度：游离 layout 默认高度=parent.height，会构成绑定环
        height: 28px;
        // 左侧弹性占位，按钮贴右下
        Rectangle { }
        Button {
            width: 132px;
            height: 28px;
            text: root.busy ? "生成中…" : "发送 (Ctrl+Enter)";
            enabled: !root.busy && ed.text != "";
            clicked => {
                root.send-submit(ed.text);
                ed.text = "";
            }
        }
    }
}

export component AppWindow inherits Window {
    title: "oWakaka";
    background: #17181c;
    preferred-width: 1120px;
    preferred-height: 720px;
    min-width: 720px;
    min-height: 460px;

    in property <[ChatMessage]> messages;
    in property <bool> busy;
    in property <[SessionItem]> sessions;
    callback send(string);
    callback copy(string); // 复制回答正文到系统剪贴板（Rust 侧经 arboard 落地）
    callback new-session();
    callback select-session(int);

    // 侧栏初始宽 190px（默认窗口 1120 的 ~17%）；不得引用 root.width，
    // 否则进入 layoutinfo 环。拖动 vsplit 改写 position 后此值即失效
    property <length> side-width: 190px;

    HorizontalLayout {
        padding: 10px;
        spacing: 0;

        SessionSidebar {
            width: vsplit.position;
            sessions: root.sessions;
            new-clicked => { root.new-session(); }
            row-clicked(i) => { root.select-session(i); }
        }
        vsplit := VSplitter {
            position: root.side-width;
            min-pos: 150px;
            max-pos: 420px;
        }

        VerticalLayout {
            spacing: 0;

            // 聊天卡片：吃满剩余高度；滚动区四周留白 8px
            Rectangle {
                vertical-stretch: 1;
                background: #1e2026;
                border-radius: 14px;
                border-width: 1px;
                border-color: #ffffff14;
                clip: true;

                ScrollView {
                    x: 8px;
                    y: 8px;
                    width: parent.width - 16px;
                    height: parent.height - 16px;
                    // 粘底状态机：viewport-y 为负值语义（0=顶部，height-viewport-height=底部）。
                    // scrolled() 仅在用户滚动时触发：滚离底部即脱离粘底，滚回底部自动恢复；
                    // 内容变化时仅当粘底才贴底。
                    property <bool> stick: true;
                    scrolled => {
                        self.stick = self.viewport-y <= self.height - self.viewport-height + 2px;
                    }
                    changed viewport-height => {
                        if (self.stick) {
                            self.viewport-y = self.height - self.viewport-height;
                        }
                    }
                    changed height => {
                        if (self.stick) {
                            self.viewport-y = self.height - self.viewport-height;
                        }
                    }
                    VerticalLayout {
                        for m in root.messages: Bubble {
                            msg: m;
                            // 手动切换即脱离自动态，此后不再被自动收起
                            think-toggled => {
                                m.tstate = Math.mod(m.tstate + 1, 3);
                                m.tauto = false;
                            }
                            copy-request(text) => { root.copy(text); }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }

            hs := HSplitter {
                position: 120px;
                min-pos: 64px;
                max-pos: 260px;
            }
            InputArea {
                height: hs.position;
                busy: root.busy;
                send-submit(text) => { root.send(text); }
            }
        }
    }
}
